.debug/

# Ad-hoc smoke/test bodies in the repo root (may carry real addresses or live
# responses), internal findings reports, and packed archives. Working material,
# never part of the package. Deliberately named, not globbed: a future root
# JSON (e.g. a tool config) must show up as untracked, not vanish silently.
/a2_smoke.json
/body.json
BEFUND_*.md
*.zip
